            "link": "",
            "heading": "OmniCol™ 120 Hydrolysed Bovine Collagen Peptides",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>The most abundant protein in your body, about 30% of all your protein. It's the key building block found in skin, bones, tendons and ligaments. After 25, you lose roughly 1-1.5% a year. This is what you're replacing.</p>",
