        "collapsible_text_LajCKp": {
          "type": "collapsible-text",
          "name": "t:names.collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Not all collagen is created equal. Most collagen supplements are hydrolysed, meaning they are broken down into smaller pieces so your body can absorb them. But how small matters. Standard collagen sits at 5,000 Dalton or larger. At that size, a lot of it passes through your gut without being absorbed.<br/><br/><strong>The collagen Lumeia uses</strong>, OmniCol™ 120, is broken down to under 2,500 Dalton. This <strong>is small enough to pass directly into your bloodstream.</strong> A study confirmed it delivers significantly more collagen into the bloodstream than standard processing.⁴ It's Halal certified at the ingredient level, with a full amino acid profile.<br/><br/><em>OmniCol™ is a trademark of Essentia Protein Solutions (BHJ A/S), Denmark.</em><br/><em>Source: Skov K et al. (2019). Enzymatic Hydrolysis of a Collagen Hydrolysate Enhances Postprandial Absorption Rate. Nutrients, 11(5):1064.</em></p>",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
