                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Most supplements give you collagen alone. That's why so many women try them and notice nothing. Your body needs Vitamin C to form collagen, Biotin and Zinc to support hair and nails, Hyaluronic Acid for skin hydration, and antioxidants & vitamins to protect what you're building. Complete Collagen puts 10,500mg of OmniCol™ 120 hydrolysed bovine collagen peptides, one of the highest you can find, with 9 other active ingredients in one sachet. That's why it's called Complete.</p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
