            "accordion_row_m76FzH": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "text": "Is there research behind this formula?",
                "open_row_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "icon_size": "custom-size",
                "width": 32,
                "width_mobile": 24
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_icCHUc": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, this took months of research and development. A 16-week study on women taking collagen with Vitamin C and Hyaluronic Acid — three of the core ingredients in this formula — found -13.9% wrinkle volume and +16.0% denser skin.⁵ Separately, a 12-week study on women taking collagen peptides found +17% improvement in skin moisture.³ Two independent reviews covering over 2,800 people confirm that collagen supplements improve skin hydration and elasticity.¹² Every reference is listed in the section below.</p>",
                    "highlight_style": "none",
                    "highlight_font_style": "italic",
                    "highlight_shape_color": "",
                    "highlight_text_color": "",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_weight": "",
                    "font_size": 15,
                    "font_size_mobile": 15,
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "text_color": "text",
                    "text_color_gradient": "",
                    "disable_line_break_mobile": false,
                    "width": "100%",
