              "blocks": {
                "text_mxpRAn": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes, and we'll be honest about it. The main additive is sucralose, a sweetener that keeps the formula enjoyable at 44kcal with no added sugar. Beyond that, Complete Collagen is almost entirely active ingredients: 87.5% collagen peptides, with the rest made up of vitamins, minerals, fruit powders, and natural colourings. No thickeners. No stabilisers. <strong>A supplement only works if you take it every day, and we designed Complete Collagen to be something you look forward to.</strong></p>",
