                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Add one sachet to 200ml of cold or sparkling water, preferably with lots of ice. Stir well with a spoon or shake in your bottle until fully dissolved. Let it sit for 5 minutes for best taste. <strong>Hint: </strong>Due to the number of active ingredients, some natural settling may occur. This is normal and doesn't affect quality. A quick stir or shake brings it back together immediately. Best taken in the morning.</p>",
